  "creator": "CrossFit",
  "description": "In a 20/14 lb vest with a 60-minute cap: a 2-mile run, then 9 rounds of a 20-calorie row and 20 burpees, then 3 rounds of 30 push-ups, 30 pull-ups and 30 burpees. Honours Darryl Fern of the Royal Regiment of Scotland, killed by a roadside IED in Kut, Iraq, in 2008. Drop the vest before dropping reps.",
